WEBVTT

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:01.255
to even deeper storytelling,

00:05:01.255 --> 00:05:04.508
which is how we end up teary-eyed

00:05:04.508 --> 00:05:09.638
after a three-and-a-half-minute
NBC vignette about a Romanian gymnast.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:10.931
(Laughter)

00:05:11.474 --> 00:05:15.686
You have everything you need, now,
for the next two hours of competition.

00:05:15.728 --> 00:05:18.189
An Olympic gold medal is on the line.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:21.192
And you’ve got your storyline.

00:05:21.567 --> 00:05:25.029
A Romanian gymnast
desperately overcoming the odds.

00:05:25.071 --> 00:05:26.322
Boom.

00:05:26.364 --> 00:05:29.325
Storylines drive up the stakes.